WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.833
Step 1: Open Settings → Award compliance. Overview shows Employer, Employees and Public holidays for each accessible trading location.

2
00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:18.042
Step 2: Choose Open setup for the location. Enter the legal employer and pay period, confirm award coverage and turn on automatic award wages, then Save settings. Optional employer cost estimates are expandable.

3
00:00:18.042 --> 00:00:32.042
Step 3: Expand Employee details → Edit details. Choose employment type, classification and allowances; Pay Rates underneath updates without saving. Add regular working hours is optional during setup; complete part-time shift costs need written hours and an agreement. Press Save employment details.

4
00:00:32.042 --> 00:00:42.625
Step 4: Choose Review dates. Check the full year’s holidays, including local, substitute and part-day periods; expand All day to edit times when needed. Confirm the review and Save location calendar.

5
00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:53.833
Step 5: Review roster and timesheet warnings and use Pay details for breaks, allowances or written variations. Missing wage inputs must be completed. Advanced rules and source details remain available for reviewed updates.
